  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">#cocreateMYCITY Durban (Part II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to increase the Dutch footprint in South Africa and expand bilateral trade and collaboration.Furthermore, the project aims to foster entrepreneurship and education and build/expand (current) networks of knowledge institutes, government and businesses (thereby supporting PPP&apos;s).In practical terms, the project strives to connect Dutch and South African students and establish cooperation in order to find tangible solutions to urban challenges in the city of Durban.By conducting this project, opportunities for Dutch companies are identified in the region, and the local business climate is improved (also by creating local jobs).</narrative>
  </description>
